[I] Logging daemon for netfilter/iptables related logging

[T] ulogd is a userspace logging daemon for netfilter/iptables related logging.
[T] This includes per-packet logging of security violations, per-packet logging
[T] for accounting, per-flow logging and flexible user-defined accounting.

[U] https://www.netfilter.org/projects/ulogd/index.html

